    "name": "Peak Week — 7-Day Contest Preparation Protocol",
    "description": "RUN THIS the 7 days before show day (T-7 → T-1, show on T-0). This is the ONLY place calendar days matter in the whole roadmap because the show is a fixed calendar event. Sequence: 2 depletion lift sessions (T-7 + T-5), 4 rest days (with progressive carb load T-4 → T-1), 1 optional light pump (T-2). Diet: low carb T-7/T-6, ramping carb load T-5 through T-2, high carb + reduced water T-1. Do a MOCK peak week 4 wks out to test your response. Do NOT use diuretics on your first show. Set app Progression Profile to CONSERVATIVE — no PRs this week. [Recommended app setting after import → Program Detail → Progression Profile = CONSERVATIVE.]",
